    "No direct query-specific CNS exposure data were provided.",
    "Retrieved analogs have modest structural similarity, and antihistamine analogs show low brain H1 occupancy, creating uncertainty.",
    "Cetirizine evidence is internally mixed, with human PET showing some H1 binding but animal and efflux studies indicating low brain uptake."
  ],
  "new_evidence_assessment": [],
  "revision_action": "initial"
}

